      "req": "REQ-2234-F1",
      "verdict": "met",
      "confidence_basis": "The new test asserts MsgPack004 is reported for a SuppressSourceGeneration type and passes on head; it also passes on base source, so the analyzer already reports this contract diagnostic and the requirement was already met on base (unchanged by this PR, which touches no analyzer code). Only the missing-key case is directly evidenced.",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "test", "name": "MsgPack00xAnalyzerTests.MissingKeyAttribute_SourceGenerationSuppressed", "outcome": "passed"},
        {"kind": "test", "name": "MsgPack00xAnalyzerTests.MissingKeyAttribute_SourceGenerationSuppressed", "outcome": "passed", "check": "tests.fail_without_fix"},
