        {"kind": "requirement", "req": "REQ-2234-F1", "quote": "The analyzer must report contract diagnostics (e.g. missing [Key], duplicate keys, mixed key kinds) for [MessagePackObject(SuppressSourceGeneration = true)] types, as it did in version 3.1.0."}
      ]
    },
    {
      "req": "REQ-2234-F2",
      "verdict": "cannot_determine",
      "confidence_basis": "No analyzer or generator source file is changed, and the specific held test SuppressSourceGenerationAnalyzerTests.SourceGenerationOnlyDiagnosticsAreNotReportedWhenSuppressed is not in the provided results, so we cannot confirm source-generation-only diagnostics are suppressed for these types.",
