      "id": "F3",
      "title": "UntrustedData.MaximumObjectGraphDepth raised 500 -> 5000, unrelated to #2234, weakens DoS guard",
      "severity": "major",
      "category": "security",
      "claim": "The depth-limit change has nothing to do with analyzer diagnostics for #2234. It raises the untrusted deserialization depth from 500 to 5000 while the property documentation describes 500 as a conservative value to defend against stack-overflow attacks on untrusted input. This is a security-relevant default change with no accompanying test or rationale.",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "code", "file": "src/MessagePack/MessagePackSecurity.cs", "line": 38, "rev": "base", "quote": "MaximumObjectGraphDepth = 500,"},
        {"kind": "code", "file": "src/MessagePack/MessagePackSecurity.cs", "line": 38, "rev": "head", "quote": "MaximumObjectGraphDepth = 5000,"},
        {"kind": "code", "file": "src/MessagePack/MessagePackSecurity.cs", "line": 84, "rev": "head", "quote": "Since stack space occupied may vary by the kind of object deserialized, a conservative value for this property to defend against stack overflow attacks might be 500."}
      ],
      "suggested_fix": "Revert MaximumObjectGraphDepth to 500 for UntrustedData, or have the security/area owner approve 5000 with a documented rationale and a deserialization test."
    },
    {
      "id": "F4",
      "title": "Requirement F1's held tests are not the test added by this change",
      "severity": "info",
      "category": "tests",
      "claim": "REQ-2234-F1 names SuppressSourceGenerationAnalyzerTests.* as its held tests, but the change adds MsgPack00xAnalyzerTests.MissingKeyAttribute_SourceGenerationSuppressed; the listed tests are not in the provided results.",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "test", "name": "MsgPack00xAnalyzerTests.MissingKeyAttribute_SourceGenerationSuppressed", "outcome": "passed"},
        {"kind": "requirement", "req": "REQ-2234-F1", "quote": "The analyzer must report contract diagnostics (e.g. missing [Key], duplicate keys, mixed key kinds) for [MessagePackObject(SuppressSourceGeneration = true)] types, as it did in version 3.1.0."}
      ]
    }
  ],
